  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Barriers that Impede Access to Education and Decent Work for Vulnerable Youth in Brazil and the Latin American and Caribbean Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the worst forms of child labor, forced labor, and human trafficking among vulnerable youth in Brazil and in the Latin America and the Caribbean region by improving the implementation of laws, policies, and national plans to reduce barriers that impede access to education and decent work. The project will work with the Government of Brazil and the tripartite actors participating in and working with the vulnerable youth community in LAC region.</narrative>
  </description>
